# Hand-written PDBx/mmCIF, not an archive entry.
#
# What it demonstrates: a `;`-delimited text field that is never closed.  It swallows the rest of the
# file -- that is what the grammar says it does -- and a reader pointed at untrusted input must report
# that rather than hang, raise, or silently return an empty block.  The atoms before it survive; the
# `_atom_site` loop after it does not exist as far as the grammar is concerned, and the log says why.
data_TESTUNTERM
_entry.id   TESTUNTERM
#
loop_
